     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Loving the new gadgets feature in Shiny v0.13. One small issue I&#39;m having though: when I run the <a href=\"http://shiny.rstudio.com/articles/gadgets.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shiny.rstudio.com/articles/gadgets.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792395101249000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1Oyef3NgmZjoJW8C0SZQtO\">example</a> on the rstudio site with the addition of </span><font size=\"4\"><span style=\"font-family:courier new,monospace\"><code><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-family:courier new,monospace\"><span>runGadget</span><span>(...,</span><span> viewer </span><span>=</span><span> dialogViewer</span></span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\"><span style=\"font-family:courier new,monospace\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">()) <font size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\">the gadget launches in my Firefox browser window. What am I missing?<br><br>OS: Ubuntu 14.04 LTS<br>R: 3.2.3<br>RStudio: Version 0.99.491</span></font></span><br><br><br></span></span></code></span></font></font><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\"></span><span style=\"color:#660\"></span><span style=\"color:#000\"></span></div></code><br><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\"></span></div></code></div>"
    ]
